REMARK 280 CRYSTALLIZATION CONDITIONS: THE NS3 PROTEIN (1MG/ML) WAS INCUBATED   
REMARK 280  AT 4C WITH THE NS4A COFACTOR PEPTIDE, CONTAINING A SOLUBIZING       
REMARK 280  LYSINE TAG AT ITS N- AND C-TERMINI(KGSVVIVGRIILSGRK), AT A MOLAR    
REMARK 280  RATIO OF 1:2 AND CONCENTRATED TO 290 MICROMOLAR. NS3J/4A            
REMARK 280  CRYSTALS, WITH A MAXIMUM SIZE OF 0.6 X 0.3 X 0.2 MM**3, WERE        
REMARK 280  OBTAINED BY BOTH HANGING- AND SITTING-DROP VAPOUR DIFFUSION         
REMARK 280  METHODS AFTER TWO WEEKS AT ROOM TEMPERATURE, WITH 3.4 M NACL,       
REMARK 280  10MM DTT, 0.1 M CITRATE BUFFER PH 5.1., PH 5.10, VAPOR DIFFUSION    
